title: "NuSMV LTL counterexample visualizer"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Buzhinsky
    given-names: Igor
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/igor-buzhinsky/nusmv_counterexample_visualizer"
abstract: >-
  Explains why an LTL property fails on a counterexample produced by the NuSMV or nuXmv model checker,
  using causal analysis and structured visualization of subformula values.
keywords:
  - model checking
  - linear temporal logic
  - counterexample explanation
  - causality
  - NuSMV
